  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KOICA Green ODA Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KOICA will provide USD 210,000 to request 1) development of PCP that will be aligned with Korea&#x2019;s Green ODA strategy and national priorities and 2) a synthesis report which will include the analysis of national policies, a country needs assessment, and lists of project ideas. The targeted countries of this project are Mongolia, Fiji, and Peru. Three PCPs (one per country) will be originated from the list of project ideas in the synthesis report. Three PCPs may have a chance of leading to the KOICA multi-bi project. PCPs must be submitted to KOICA by the end of August for their internal PCP review process in September and the synthesis report by the end of October.</narrative>
  </description>
